      "description": "Noninteractive evidence label with an inline SVG symbol.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-chip\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5\"/></svg>Registered</span>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:22px;padding:0 8px;border:1px solid var(--info-stroke,rgba(134,170,255,.26));border-radius:999px;background:var(--info-bg,rgba(134,170,255,.1));color:var(--info,#86aaff);font:500 11.5px/1 var(--sans,Geist,sans-serif);white-space:nowrap}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Filter Chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "filter",
      "description": "Interactive list filter with selected count.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-filter\" aria-pressed=\"true\">All <b>3</b></button>",
      "css": ".ds-filter{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:32px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid var(--stroke-2,rgba(255,255,255,.13));border-radius:999px;background:var(--glass-2,rgba(255,255,255,.06));color:var(--text,#f2f4f8);font:500 12.5px var(--sans,Geist,sans-serif);cursor:pointer;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.07)}.ds-filter b{font:500 11px var(--mono,monospace);color:var(--accent,#86aaff)}.ds-filter:hover{border-color:var(--stroke-3,rgba(255,255,255,.22))}.ds-filter:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#86aaff);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Technology Tag",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "technology-tag",
      "description": "Compact manifest label.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-tag\">Node</span>",
      "css": ".ds-tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:20px;padding:0 7px;border:1px solid var(--stroke,rgba(255,255,255,.075));border-radius:5px;background:var(--glass,rgba(255,255,255,.035));color:var(--text-2,#c9cfdb);font:500 11px var(--mono,monospace)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Shared Project Table",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "project-table",
      "description": "One divided table with common six-column alignment; static rows stack below 1000px.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-table\"><header class=\"ds-head\"><span>Project</span><span>Branch</span><span>Agents</span><span>Services</span><span>Links</span><span></span></header><div class=\"ds-row\"><strong>Project</strong><span>main</span><span>\u2014</span><span>\u2014</span><span>\u2014</span><button aria-label=\"Project actions\">\u22ef</button></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-table{border:1px solid var(--stroke-2,rgba(255,255,255,.13));border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#0c0f16;color:var(--text,#f2f4f8);font:12px/1.5 var(--sans,Geist,sans-serif)}.ds-head,.ds-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,22fr) minmax(0,12fr) minmax(0,26fr) minmax(0,18fr) minmax(0,16fr) minmax(44px,6fr);align-items:center}.ds-head{padding:12px 20px;background:#10141c;color:var(--muted,#929eb2)}.ds-row{padding:22px 20px;min-height:96px;border-top:1px solid var(--stroke,rgba(255,255,255,.075))}.ds-row>*{min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-row strong{font-size:15px}.ds-row button{justify-self:end;min-width:34px;min-height:34px;background:transparent;color:inherit;border:0}.ds-row button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#86aaff);outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:999px){.ds-head{display:none}.ds-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 44px;gap:12px 8px;padding:18px 20px}.ds-row>*{grid-column:1/-1}.ds-row strong{grid-column:1;grid-row:1}.ds-row button{grid-column:2;grid-row:1;min-width:44px;min-height:44px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Agent Circle",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "agent-circle",
      "description": "Individual 38px sourced vendor mark; detected-process uptime sits beneath it. Initials are a fallback.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-agent\"><span class=\"ds-mark\" aria-label=\"Agent initials fallback\">A</span><span class=\"ds-duration\">12m</span></span>",
      "css": ".ds-agent{display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:5px;width:38px}.ds-mark{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:#161b25;border:1px solid var(--stroke,rgba(255,255,255,.075));color:var(--text,#f2f4f8);font:12px var(--sans,Geist,sans-serif)}.ds-duration{font:10px var(--mono,monospace);color:var(--muted,#929eb2);white-space:nowrap}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Details Panel",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "details-panel",
      "description": "Native modal side panel on desktop, fullscreen below 1000px; labeled records wrap complete values at every width.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-details\"><header><h2>Project</h2><button>Close</button></header><dl><div><dt>Path</dt><dd>/workspace/project</dd></div><div><dt>Status</dt><dd>Unknown</dd></div></dl></section>",
      "css": ".ds-details{box-sizing:border-box;margin-left:auto;width:min(900px,90vw);padding:24px;background:#0c0f16;color:var(--text,#f2f4f8);border-left:1px solid var(--stroke-2,rgba(255,255,255,.13));font:14px/1.5 var(--sans,Geist,sans-serif)}.ds-details header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-bottom:20px}.ds-details h2{margin:0;font-size:22px}.ds-details button{background:var(--glass-2,rgba(255,255,255,.06));color:inherit;border:1px solid var(--stroke-2,rgba(255,255,255,.13));border-radius:8px;padding:0 12px;min-height:34px}.ds-details button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#86aaff);outline-offset:3px}.ds-details dl{margin:0}.ds-details dl>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(90px,25%) minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;padding:6px 16px}.ds-details dt{color:var(--muted,#929eb2);font-size:12px}.ds-details dd{margin:0;min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:var(--mono,monospace)}@media(max-width:999px){.ds-details{width:100%;border-left:0;padding:20px}}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-details{padding:16px}.ds-details button{min-height:44px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Signal",
    "overview": "Signal places trustworthy project, runtime and URL observations in one shared table on a restrained near-black canvas. Fine borders, quiet blue links and a faint fading grid support scanning. The user's approved replacement interface supersedes the earlier Signal HTML/image references; those files remain historical evidence. The shipped React components and ordinary CSS define the implemented system.\n\nGeist provides compact interface text; Geist Mono distinguishes paths, ports, branches, times and counts. Rows remain static. Project actions open Details in a side panel, keeping the shared table concise and the full observations accessible.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "One rounded shared observation table with static divided rows.",
      "Geist interface typography paired with Geist Mono technical metadata.",
      "Individual 38px agent circles with actual detected-process uptime.",
      "Desktop Details side panel and fullscreen Details at 999px and below."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Evidence Rule",
        "body": "Registered and Detected describe agent evidence; Listening describes a socket; Published describes a route. None establishes activity, completion or verified availability. Green links require HTTPS verification.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Technical Type Rule",
        "body": "Use Geist for interface language and Geist Mono for technical identifiers and observations; retain tabular numerals.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Surface Rule",
        "body": "Use shared alignment, fine borders and restrained opaque tonal surfaces for hierarchy; keep depth attached to controls and overlays.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do retain one shared table and static project rows.",
      "Do show individual real agent marks and actual detected-process uptime.",
      "Do show concise real links and require verification for green link state.",
      "Do retain the 999px stacked-row/fullscreen-Details breakpoint.",
      "Do wrap full technical values in labeled Details records.",
      "Do preserve local fonts, accessible state labels, keyboard focus and action failures."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't infer activity from registration, readiness from a socket or HTTPS verification from publication.",
      "Don't restore separate project cards, inline row expansion or always-visible lifecycle controls.",
      "Don't use the historical Signal reference as authority over the approved replacement.",
      "Don't add account chrome, system-stat cards, editable Settings, dependencies or fabricated vendor logos."
    ]
  }
}
